  "description": "Twins or Tens is a fun and relaxing number puzzle game.\n\nYour goal is simple — connect numbers in one line to match identical numbers or create combinations with a total sum of 10. The rules are easy to learn, but the game becomes more challenging as you play.\n\nThink carefully, plan your moves, and clear the board to get the highest score possible. The game is perfect for quick sessions or longer relaxing play.\n\nGame Features:\nEasy to learn gameplay\nFun and challenging puzzles\nClean and pleasant visuals\nSuitable for all ages\nGreat way to relax and train your brain\n\nCan you find the best combinations and clear the board?\n",
